      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter to resolve. This parameter must have previously been passed to\n         <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a> which must have returned true.",
      "translation": "<code>parameter</code> - 要解析的方法参数。此参数必须此前已传递给 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该方法必须返回 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>binderFactory</code> - a factory for creating <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> instances",
      "translation": "<binderFactory> - 用于创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> 实例的工厂",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the resolved argument value or null if the value cannot be resolved. The returned value\n        considers <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html#isOptional()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Optional</code></a> wrapping by returing either the value wrapped\n        within Optional or Optional.empty().",
      "translation": "已解析的实参值，或者在无法解析该值时返回 null。返回值会考虑对 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html#isOptional()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Optional</code></a>` 的包装，通过返回 Optional 中封装的值或 Optional.empty() 来实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
